docs(hydrofrac): lite baseline over lite's corpus

The raw lite-mode numbers for the paused lite-vs-races comparison: one row per
label (verdict, fault sets, schedules, wall time) for every `EcCheck` run in
`hydrofrac` (with `cross-check`), `hydro_std`'s `ec_abd_hydrofrac` and
`hydro_test`'s `cluster::ec_*`, measured at `d2e851a8c5`. 240 label results.
Runs built with `EcCheck::races()` directly are left out.
